10 REM A rainbow fan: MOVE and DRAW in the 320x200 bitmap
20 MODE 8
30 FOR C%=1 TO 7:VDU 19,C%,C%,0,0,0:NEXT
40 COLOUR 7:PRINT TAB(9,0);"RAINBOW STRING ART"
50 FOR X%=0 TO 1279 STEP 32
60 GCOL 0,1+(X% DIV 32) MOD 7
70 MOVE 640,100:DRAW X%,850
80 NEXT
90 FOR Y%=100 TO 850 STEP 32
100 GCOL 0,1+(Y% DIV 32) MOD 7
110 MOVE 640,100:DRAW 0,Y%:MOVE 640,100:DRAW 1279,Y%
120 NEXT
130 COLOUR 7:PRINT TAB(8,14);"Any key: back to text";
140 A$=GET$
150 MODE 3
160 END
